{
  "info": {
    "name": "Matilha - Endpoints",
    "description": "Todos os endpoints do Matilha, um por requisição, sem testes e sem roteiro. Para explorar a API à vontade.\nO roteiro com testes é a outra collection, matilha.postman_collection.json.\n\nPara pegar um token: abra a aba Authorization da coleção, clique em \"Get New Access Token\" e depois em \"Use Token\".\nO usuário vem das variáveis username e password (ana / ana123 por padrão). Para agir como outra pessoa, troque as\nvariáveis (bruno / bruno123, ou suporte / suporte123, que é o admin) e peça um token novo. O token vale 5 minutos.\n\nO client é o matilha-dev-cli, que aceita usuário e senha direto e existe só para desenvolvimento (keycloak/README.md).\nAs requisições do /internal/** e os health checks vão sem token, direto no serviço.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "oauth2",
    "oauth2": [
      {
        "key": "grant_type",
        "value": "password_credentials",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "accessTokenUrl",
        "value": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/matilha/protocol/openid-connect/token",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "clientId",
        "value": "matilha-dev-cli",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{username}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{password}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "client_authentication",
        "value": "body",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "tokenName",
        "value": "matilha-dev-cli",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "addTokenTo",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081"
    },
    {
      "key": "transferUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082"
    },
    {
      "key": "notificationUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8083"
    },
    {
      "key": "keycloakUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8180"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "ana"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "ana123"
    },
    {
      "key": "ownerId",
      "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountNumber",
      "value": "10001"
    },
    {
      "key": "targetAccountNumber",
      "value": "10002"
    },
    {
      "key": "transferId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Keycloak",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token (password grant, matilha-dev-cli)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/matilha/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": [
                "{{keycloakUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "realms",
                "matilha",
                "protocol",
                "openid-connect",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "matilha-dev-cli"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{username}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{password}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "O mesmo pedido que o \"Get New Access Token\" faz, aqui à mostra. Cole o access_token em jwt.io ou decodifique o meio do token para ver as claims."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Configuração do OpenID Connect",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/matilha/.well-known/openid-configuration",
              "host": [
                "{{keycloakUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "realms",
                "matilha",
                ".well-known",
                "openid-configuration"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Chaves públicas (JWKS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/matilha/protocol/openid-connect/certs",
              "host": [
                "{{keycloakUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "realms",
                "matilha",
                "protocol",
                "openid-connect",
                "certs"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "As chaves que o gateway e os serviços usam para conferir a assinatura dos tokens."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Account",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{accountUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{accountUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transfer",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{transferUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{transferUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Notification",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{notificationUrl}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [
                "{{notificationUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Contas (/accounts)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Abrir conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"holderName\": \"Ana Silva\",\n  \"holderDocument\": \"52998224725\",\n  \"holderEmail\": \"ana.poupanca@example.com\",\n  \"holderPhone\": \"11987654321\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "O dono da conta é quem está no token, nunca um campo do corpo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar minhas contas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts?page=0&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "O cliente vê só as próprias contas; o admin (suporte) vê todas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts",
                "{{accountNumber}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Alterar dados do titular",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts",
                "{{accountNumber}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"holderName\": \"Ana Silva\",\n  \"holderEmail\": \"ana.silva@example.com\",\n  \"holderPhone\": \"11987654321\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Encerrar conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountNumber}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts",
                "{{accountNumber}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Só com saldo zero."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Bloquear conta (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/block",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts",
                "{{accountNumber}}",
                "block"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exige o papel admin: use username suporte / password suporte123."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desbloquear conta (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/unblock",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "accounts",
                "{{accountNumber}}",
                "unblock"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exige o papel admin: use username suporte / password suporte123."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Transferências (/transfers)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Transferir",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transfers",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transfers"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sourceAccountNumber\": \"{{accountNumber}}\",\n  \"targetAccountNumber\": \"{{targetAccountNumber}}\",\n  \"amount\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "A Idempotency-Key é nova a cada envio. Para testar o reenvio, troque {{$guid}} por um UUID fixo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar transferência",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transfers/{{transferId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transfers",
                "{{transferId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Copie o id da resposta do \"Transferir\" para a variável transferId."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Notificações (/notifications)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Minhas notificações (todas as contas)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=0&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "notifications"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Minhas notificações de uma conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/notifications?accountNumber={{accountNumber}}&page=0&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "notifications"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "accountNumber",
                  "value": "{{accountNumber}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Interno (direto no account, sem token)",
      "description": "O gateway não tem rota para o /internal/**: estas requisições vão direto na porta do account. No kind, precisam do port-forward: kubectl port-forward svc/account 8081:8081.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Depósito (sistema de pagamentos)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{accountUrl}}/internal/deposits",
              "host": [
                "{{accountUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "internal",
                "deposits"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"depositId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"accountNumber\": \"{{accountNumber}}\",\n  \"amount\": 100\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transferência interna (o que o transfer chama)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{accountUrl}}/internal/transfers",
              "host": [
                "{{accountUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "internal",
                "transfers"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transferId\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"{{ownerId}}\",\n  \"sourceAccountNumber\": \"{{accountNumber}}\",\n  \"targetAccountNumber\": \"{{targetAccountNumber}}\",\n  \"amount\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Move dinheiro de verdade. O ownerId precisa ser o dono da conta de origem."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}